&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;This subsystem uses Simulink 3D Animation&apos;s interface to measure terrain at the location of the 3D vehicle&apos;s wheels and is only recommended to be used with vehicles with lateral degrees of freedom at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</P>
